            "title": "Ingredients",
            "text": "<p>Nineteen active ingredients in two capsules, each declared on the label with its dose: nicotinamide riboside 300mg, trimethylglycine 450mg, vitamin D3 2000IU, vitamin K2 (MK-7) 100µg, the full B complex, zinc and copper bisglycinate, grapeseed extract 150mg, trans-resveratrol 50mg, coenzyme Q10 150mg, PQQ 20mg and Bioperine® 5mg. No proprietary blends.</p>"
