        },
        "a2": {
          "type": "fold",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Testing & Manufacturing",
            "text": "<p>Made in the UK by a GMP-certified manufacturer. Every batch is third-party tested for identity, potency and contaminants before it is released, and the certificate of analysis is available on request.</p>"
          }
        },
        "a3": {
          "type": "fold",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How to take it",
            "text": "<p>Two capsules together each morning with your first meal. Fat helps the fat-soluble ingredients absorb, so whatever you already eat first is the right time. No cycling, no loading and no rest days — the protocol is daily.</p>"
          }
        },
        "a4": {
          "type": "fold",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Delivery, Skips & Cancelling",
            "text": "<p>Free next-day delivery in the UK. Your subscription renews every four weeks, and you can skip, pause or cancel from your account at any time without contacting anyone.</p>"
          }
        },
