    "faq": {
      "type": "muto-crea-faq",
      "blocks": {
        "q1": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How will I know if it's working?",
            "text": "<p>Take a baseline before your first capsule — a 7-day average from your wearable, or a 30-second note on how you feel if you don't wear one. Then compare 30-day averages at day 30, 60 and 90: HRV, resting heart rate, recovery score, sleep, and how your afternoons go. Single nights are noise; months are signal.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q2": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "title": "When might I notice something?",
            "text": "<p>Give it 60 to 90 days, taken daily, before you judge it. Some people notice a difference in their energy or recovery within the first few weeks; others notice nothing early on. Read wearable data as 30-day averages, not single nights. That’s why the guarantee runs for 90 days.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q3": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is it safe with my other supplements?",
            "text": "<p>In most cases, yes, and coffee is fine. Watch for doubling up: a separate B complex, zinc, vitamin D, K2 or NAD+ product will overlap with what’s already in MUTO, so check your other labels against ours. If you take prescription medicine, check with your GP or pharmacist first: MUTO contains vitamin K2 (100µg), which can affect blood thinners such as warfarin. Not for use during pregnancy or breastfeeding, or for anyone under 18.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q4": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What if it’s not for me?",
            "text": "<p>If you subscribe, take MUTO daily and don’t see a difference within 90 days, we’ll refund every subscription payment you’ve made in that time, less our delivery costs. Email <a href=\"mailto:hello@mutolongevity.com\">hello@mutolongevity.com</a> within 90 days of your first order with your name, order number and a line on your experience, and we’ll refund your original payment method within 7 working days. You don’t need to send any wearable data.</p><p>The guarantee covers first-time subscribers buying at muto.co, one claim per customer. One-time purchases and orders through Amazon or other retailers aren’t covered. You can skip, pause or cancel online at any time.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q5": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Why not just take NR on its own?",
            "text": "<p>You can, but NR alone covers one input. MUTO pairs it with nutrients that have authorised roles in how your body makes and uses energy (B vitamins and copper for normal energy-yielding metabolism, zinc for protecting cells from oxidative stress), plus CoQ10, TMG, resveratrol and PQQ. One routine instead of several separate products.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q6": {
          "type": "q",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Do I need a wearable?",
            "text": "<p>No. A wearable makes tracking easier, but a 30-second weekly check-in (energy, sleep, afternoons, mood, each out of 10) works too. Writing it down is what turns a feeling into a record you can look back on.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
